{"id":27818,"slug":"carlos","title":"Carlos","year":2010,"country":"Germany, France","duration":339,"spine":582,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/27818-carlos","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/b8f27f08c7cc2f7aceef556aeabd34a1/4FaToSZftu4ecmPzU6OwQggfBTSGoU_large.jpg","description":"Carlos, directed by Olivier Assayas, is an epic, intensely detailed account of the life of the infamous international terrorist Ilich Ramírez Sánchez—also known as Carlos the Jackal. One of the twentieth century’s most wanted fugitives, Carlos was committed to violent left-wing activism throughout the seventies and eighties, orchestrating bombings, kidnappings, and hijackings in Europe and the Middle East. Assayas portrays him not as a criminal mastermind but as a symbol of seismic political shifts around the world, while the magnetic Édgar Ramírez brilliantly embodies him as a swaggering global gangster. Criterion presents the complete, uncut, director-approved, five-and-a-half-hour version of Carlos.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Olivier Assayas","slug":"olivier-assayas"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Édgar Ramírez","role":"Ilich Ramirez Sanchez (a.k.a. Carlos)","slug":"edgar-ramirez"},{"actor":"Alexander Scheer","role":"Johannes Weinrich","slug":"alexander-scheer"},{"actor":"Nora Von Waldstatten","role":"Magdalena Kopp","slug":"nora-von-waldstatten"},{"actor":"Ahmad Kaabour","role":"Wadie Haddad","slug":"ahmad-kaabour"},{"actor":"Christoph Bach","role":"Hans-Joachim Klein (a.k.a. Angie)","slug":"christoph-bach"},{"actor":"Rodney El-Haddad","role":"Anis Naccache (a.k.a. Khalid)","slug":"rodney-el-haddad"},{"actor":"Julia Hummer","role":"Gabriele Kröcher-Tiedemann (a.k.a. Nada)","slug":"julia-hummer"},{"actor":"Rami Farah","role":"Joseph","slug":"rami-farah"},{"actor":"Zeid Hamdan","role":"Youssef","slug":"zeid-hamdan"},{"actor":"Talal el-Jurdi","role":"Kamal al-Issawi (a.k.a. Ali)","slug":"talal-el-jurdi"},{"actor":"Fadi Abi Samra","role":"Michel Mo